    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:ad36f46e192c7e3e",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "f808f181e29c32128efa59a2d6be981fda09e3a4c4309d1abbcec96d792dd977",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-j0syfklx5tj",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Tour Cusco with an English-speaking guide and visit Qorikancha, the Temple of the Sun. The Incas held their principal ritual celebration here on the winter solstice. Then visit four nearby archaeological sites: Qenqo Temple, the red fortress of Puka Pukara, Tambomachay, where the Incas worshipped water, and the Sacsayhuamán complex, with religious structures, a fortress, towers and channels built from enormous stone blocks."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:9098585191e5d674",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "57f78cefaa0f8a469da447be422871af74e36d3c62dfaf2a12fa1d6b4dd44b14",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-j0syfklx5tj",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "After the tour, transfer to the airport for your flight to Lima, the capital of Peru. On arrival in Lima, transfer to your hotel."
    },
